  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Womp6/womps-shellfish-mod/blob/fabric-1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/shellfish/shellfish_title_text.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Womp&#x27;s Shellfish Mod\"></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/womps-shellfish-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/897290?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=780a15\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Womp6/womps-shellfish-mod/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MOD_WIKI-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=bookstack&logoColor=white&color=780a15\" alt=\"模組維基\"> </a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC_DEPENDENCIES-FABRIC_API-white?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=white&color=780a15\" alt=\"Fabric API\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/womps-shellfish-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FORGE_DEPENDENCIES-NONE-white?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=white&color=780a15\" alt=\"無 Forge 相依性\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/womps-shellfish-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NEOFORGE_DEPENDENCIES-NONE-white?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=white&color=780a15\" alt=\"無 NeoForge 相依性\"> </a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🔥 它新增了什麼？</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-width:medium\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:20.506928%\"><strong>🦞 新貝類</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:79.493072%\">9 種全新貝類，會出現在所有水域甚至海灘上。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:20.506928%\"><strong>🌱 植物</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:79.493072%\">10 種新植物，讓世界的自然風貌更加繁榮，其中 6 種為水生植物，4 種生長在陸地上。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:20.506928%\"><strong>🍖 新食物</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:79.493072%\">超過 30 種新食物讓你的飲食更加多元，並包含通用的生熟食貝類。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:20.506928%\"><strong>🎣 貝類陷阱</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:79.493072%\">透過 2 種不同的貝類陷阱體驗全新的釣魚方式，能獲得垃圾、寶藏，以及最重要的貝類！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:20.506928%\"><strong>🌎 世界生成</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:79.493072%\">在所有水生生態域中新增世界生成內容，無論是海洋或沼澤，都能為你的世界增添更多生機，並新增一個充滿活力的濕地生態域。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:20.506928%\"><strong>🤝 相容性</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:medium;width:79.493072%\">使用模組生態域或 TerraBlender 嗎？本模組的貝類可在 Biomes O&#x27; Plenty 的生態域中生成，而濕地生態域在可用時也會使用並相容於 TerraBlender！全部皆為<strong>選配！</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⁉️ 有意見回饋嗎？</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252fNhPAvBq7aXBG9j6S9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此送出！</a> 歡迎提供任何建議。</p>",
